---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StickyCTA from "../../components/StickyCTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Funding & Grants | Resources | E3 CoE"
  description="Clear pathways to public, private, and philanthropic funding—designed to help organizations move from eligibility to execution."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white">
    <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white py-32 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,')] opacity-20"></div>
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
              Turning Opportunity Into Funded Action
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-2">
              Clear pathways to public, private, and philanthropic funding—designed to help organizations move from eligibility to execution.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              We educate on how to diversify your funding segments for higher commitments.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="#opportunities"
            class="inline-block bg-[#5B9BD5] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#3D7FC1] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
          >
            Explore Funding Opportunities
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
            The Challenge
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Funding is no longer readily available as giving strategies have changed — And access is complex. Many organizations miss opportunities due to misalignment, readiness gaps, or unclear requirements.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="opportunities" class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            What We Provide
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Comprehensive support to help you identify, secure, and manage funding
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#5B9BD5] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#5B9BD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  Curated Funding Opportunities
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Federal, state, regional, and philanthropic sources
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Access a carefully curated database of funding opportunities from government agencies, foundations, and private sector partners aligned with economic development priorities.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#5B9BD5] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#5B9BD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  Grant Readiness Guidance
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Governance, compliance, and documentation support
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Ensure your organization is prepared to apply and manage grants with templates, checklists, and frameworks that address governance, compliance, and reporting requirements.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#5B9BD5] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#5B9BD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  Match & Partnership Strategies
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Stronger, more competitive applications
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Build strategic partnerships and leverage matching funds to strengthen your applications and demonstrate community support and collaboration.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#5B9BD5] bg-opacity-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#5B9BD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                  Funding Intelligence Updates
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">
                  → Stay ahead of deadlines and priorities
                </p>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  Receive timely updates on new funding opportunities, policy changes, and strategic priorities from federal, state, and philanthropic funders.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Validation
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#5B9BD5] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#5B9BD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-lg">
              Aligned with Federal Compliance Expectations
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Our guidance and tools are designed to meet the stringent requirements of federal grant programs and regulatory frameworks.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#5B9BD5] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#5B9BD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-lg">
              Built for Audit, Reporting, & Sustainability
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Comprehensive frameworks that help you not just win grants, but manage them effectively with proper documentation and accountability.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#5B9BD5] bg-opacity-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#5B9BD5]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-lg">
              Designed to Reduce Application Friction
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Streamlined processes and clear guidance that eliminate common barriers and help you submit competitive applications with confidence.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">
          Ready to Find the Right Funding?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg mb-8">
          Connect with funding opportunities that align with your organization's mission and capacity.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-block bg-[#5B9BD5] text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg hover:bg-[#3D7FC1] transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg"
        >
          Find Funding That Fits
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <StickyCTA
      title="Access Growth Intelligence"
      description="Get actionable insights, data, and resources to accelerate regional economic development."
      ctaText="Access Growth Intelligence"
      ctaHref="/resources/guides-toolkits"
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
